  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task here is to add a command line parameter for generating a TSV of the validation results (as an alternative to the HTML report).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It might nice to be able to generate both HTML and TSV in a single run.    So perhaps we add --report-formats=html,tsv .  The default will be html, but users can optionally generate one, the other or both. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
